<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Edelnor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Edelnor started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said analyst Samuel Gmez started coverage of Peruvian power distributor Edelnor SA with an underperform rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Santander expects earnings per share to increase slightly to $0.07 and $0.08 for 1997 and 1998, respectively, from $0.05 in 1996,&quot; Gomez wrote in a March 25 report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The 12- to 18-month target price of 2.80 soles implies 12 percent upside in U.S. dollar terms.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Edelnor closed Tuesday at 2.24 soles.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
